curl.nvim
---------

simple curl integration to neovim. btw this is ai slop.


INSTILL

    vim.pack.add { "https://github.com/olexsmir/curl.nvim" }
    require("curl").setup {}

CONFIGURATION

    require("curl").setup {
      curl = nil, -- path to binary, leave nil to use one in $PATH
      default_flags = { "-i" }, -- by default {}
      open_cmd = "vsplit",
      map_execute = "<CR>",
    }

